OL,3,GNEWSAMan who murdered stepmother's ex
OL,4,Aand ate finger jailed for life
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: this story contains graphic
OL,7,Fcontent which some readers might find
OL,8,Fdistressing
OL,10,FA murderer who stabbed his victim 22
OL,11,Ftimes before cooking and eating his
OL,12,Ffinger and setting his flat on fire has
OL,13,Fbeen jailed for life and told he will
OL,14,Fserve at least 23 years.
OL,16,FGabriel Brown killed Joseph Ernest
OL,17,FJohnston, 58, at the victim's home in
OL,18,FAnnan, Dumfries and Galloway, on 19
OL,19,FNovember 2024.
