OL,6,FBrown, 35, had denied murder with a
OL,7,Fspecial defence that he was suffering
OL,8,Ffrom a mental disorder at the time and
OL,9,Fbelieved he had been possessed by the
OL,10,Fspirit of 19th Century occultist
OL,11,FAleister Crowley.
